  "vibe": "A hot shop at working temperature: dark ember brown (#1c1512) with a molten gather (#ff9633), aquamarine glass (#6fd8d0) and sand (#e8dcc4) type. Comfortaa's rounded display face matches the blobs; Livvic carries the batch notes. Right of frame a furnace box glows — an orange ellipse breathing on sin(3t) around a pale #ffd9a0 core — while three heat plumes rise from its mouth and loop every 140px. A blowpipe enters from the left at 18°, its gather pulsing ±12%, and a cooling shelf holds three outlined vessels in aqua, orange and sand across which a specular highlight sweeps and lights each in turn. Despite the fire, the motion is Calm: 0.5° roll, 8px vertical drift, drowse titles, 22px glow cards. It owns a furnace-climb gauge, handwritten batch notes and drop-in kiln alerts.",
